WEBVTT

00:30.030 --> 00:32.324
THE OHAGI OF DOOM

00:32.408 --> 00:34.910
- <i>The Ohagi of Doom.</i>
- <i>The Ohagi of Doom.</i>

00:40.541 --> 00:42.960
What? There's a ghost?

00:43.043 --> 00:46.213
I've been standing in line
for three goddamn days...

00:46.297 --> 00:50.301
just to enter the Rock-Paper-Scissors
Battle for a chance to buy one of ten,

00:50.384 --> 00:53.721
'Ohagi Unicorns' from KYOTO,
the legendary Asian sweets shop...

00:53.804 --> 00:57.475
You think I've got time to waste
on a ghost?!

00:57.558 --> 00:58.934
Goodbye!

01:02.313 --> 01:05.107
This is way too cute!
I could seriously watch it forever!

01:05.191 --> 01:08.277
I need to have it! I need it! I need it!

01:09.195 --> 01:10.321
Now begins...

01:10.404 --> 01:13.407
the Rock-Paper-Scissors Battle...

01:13.491 --> 01:17.745
to win the right to purchase
the Ohagi Unicorn!

01:17.828 --> 01:21.582
- Challengers, are you prepared?
- Yeah!

01:22.291 --> 01:24.502
Time to show the angel's power
of good luck.

01:24.585 --> 01:26.504
Rock, paper,

01:26.587 --> 01:29.131
scissors, go!

01:29.673 --> 01:32.968
Oh, my God! I'm the scissors master!

01:33.052 --> 01:34.094
Fuck!

01:34.178 --> 01:38.224
Oh, may the sweet rice ball be with us.

01:41.602 --> 01:43.938
Yummy, yummy, yummy. I love mochi.

01:44.021 --> 01:46.899
But I hate this bean paste.

01:48.317 --> 01:50.152
No!

01:51.195 --> 01:53.739
Rock, paper, scissors.

01:53.823 --> 01:56.242
Go! Go! Go!

01:56.325 --> 01:58.911
Go! Go!

01:58.994 --> 02:00.454
Yahoo!

02:01.747 --> 02:05.626
Whether you like it or not, there's only
one ticket left for the Ohagi Unicorn.

02:05.709 --> 02:09.338
The final remaining contestant
will win the ticket!

02:09.421 --> 02:11.340
Let's do this... fair and square!

02:11.423 --> 02:12.675
- Rock!
- Paper!

02:12.758 --> 02:14.343
- Scissors!
- Go!

02:15.469 --> 02:16.679
Go!

02:16.762 --> 02:18.681
Who are you?

02:18.764 --> 02:21.016
I was born of the grudge
of the girl who died

02:21.100 --> 02:24.395
from not getting to eat KYOTO's
limited-edition Ohagi last year.

02:24.478 --> 02:27.064
I am Okashi Daisuki Sato-Ichi.

02:27.439 --> 02:29.316
Wow, Clone Wars!

02:29.400 --> 02:30.568
Oh, my God! Oh, my God!

02:30.651 --> 02:34.321
How is she a clone of me?
I'm way cuter than her.

02:34.405 --> 02:37.366
But if you're a ghost,
that makes things easier.

02:37.449 --> 02:38.617
Rock,

02:38.701 --> 02:40.202
paper, scissors. Go!

02:41.912 --> 02:44.290
- I am the 'Dual Wielding' Sato-Ni!
- I'm the 'Monohoshizao' Sato-San!

02:44.373 --> 02:46.709
- Rock, paper, scissors.
- Rock, paper, scissors.

02:46.792 --> 02:47.918
- Go!
- Go!

02:54.466 --> 02:56.886
I am the 'Lone Wolf and Cub' Sato-Yon!

02:57.511 --> 03:00.347
I am the 'Ninja' Sato-Go.

03:00.431 --> 03:03.309
I am the 'Unfettered' Sato-Roku.

03:03.392 --> 03:06.604
We are the 'Seven Satos' Sato-Nana!

03:07.313 --> 03:09.857
- Rock, paper, scissors!
- Go!

03:10.399 --> 03:11.442
Go!

03:11.525 --> 03:12.568
Go!

03:12.651 --> 03:15.446
Go!

03:18.949 --> 03:22.912
Can you kill a kitty
with innocent eyes like me?

03:22.995 --> 03:26.457
You're just some knockoff Honekoneko!

03:26.540 --> 03:28.042
Help me. Meow.

03:28.959 --> 03:30.628
It's cute!

03:30.711 --> 03:33.005
Meow, meow, meow.

03:35.299 --> 03:37.009
The younger Poly Peeps brother?

03:37.092 --> 03:39.386
You're going after the Ohagi Unicorn too?

03:39.470 --> 03:41.513
What? Ohagi? What are you talking about?

03:41.597 --> 03:43.974
Fighting ghosts is
an angel's routine duty.

03:44.058 --> 03:46.560
- So you have allies.
- I'm doing what I should.

03:46.644 --> 03:49.104
- If there's two of you, then...
- Don't step on me! Stop! Ow!

03:49.188 --> 03:51.982
...watch this!

03:53.359 --> 03:54.902
One hundred million

03:55.486 --> 03:57.821
ghosts!

03:57.905 --> 04:01.784
I'm all about the easy Heaven Coins.

04:02.409 --> 04:04.745
Lowkey super thankful for this.

04:06.330 --> 04:10.876
Look at the time!
That's the end of my shift!

04:10.960 --> 04:14.254
Switching to private time...
Peace! Great work today!

04:14.338 --> 04:18.217
Why did you even come?

04:18.300 --> 04:20.469
You good-for-nothing brat!

04:25.766 --> 04:28.727
Rock, paper, scissors!

04:28.811 --> 04:32.022
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

04:34.817 --> 04:37.695
I can't kill one hundred million of them
with just two swords.

04:37.778 --> 04:40.239
Gunsmith Bitch!

04:40.322 --> 04:41.949
Sell me a sword

04:42.032 --> 04:44.284
that can slay one hundred million ghosts!

04:44.368 --> 04:47.454
Thanks for your business! Counterfeit,
irregular, watered down, and reinforced!

04:47.538 --> 04:49.832
I'll name you a price!

04:49.915 --> 04:54.920
Super Shingan Stripe!

04:57.381 --> 05:00.884
I will never hand over
the last Ohagi Unicorn!

05:20.112 --> 05:23.115
Killing one hundred million ghosts.
Accomplished!

05:23.991 --> 05:26.076
This is the ticket

05:26.160 --> 05:28.537
to buy an Ohagi Unicorn!

05:28.620 --> 05:31.290
Finally! It's finally mine.

05:31.373 --> 05:33.167
- Here, your bill.
- What?

05:33.250 --> 05:37.004
The Heaven Coins from defeating those
one hundred million ghosts isn't enough.

05:37.087 --> 05:39.173
- Do you not have money?
- Nope.

05:39.256 --> 05:41.008
Then I'll be taking this.

05:41.091 --> 05:43.218
My Ohagi Unicorn...

05:44.261 --> 05:46.013
It's too sweet! Gross!

05:55.022 --> 05:57.357
NOT 2 HOME ALONE

05:57.441 --> 05:59.902
- <i>Not 2 Home alone.</i>
- <i>Not 2 Home alone.</i>

06:11.413 --> 06:12.998
Looks like no one's home.

06:13.082 --> 06:16.168
So, that means, like, you know,
our plan's working?

06:16.251 --> 06:17.628
- Yay!
- Yay!

06:21.465 --> 06:23.550
<i>I think there's a ghost over here.</i>

06:23.634 --> 06:26.553
You keep saying "over here!" Over where?

06:26.637 --> 06:28.555
<i>It's, like, over here?</i>

06:28.639 --> 06:29.640
Oh, my god!

06:29.723 --> 06:32.267
Those assholes!
I don't care who or where!

06:32.351 --> 06:35.104
We're the ones takin'
down that damn ghost first!

06:37.439 --> 06:41.819
I bet they're like, getting caught
in all our traps right now.

06:41.902 --> 06:45.948
Like, our plan to distract them
and find their weaknesses

06:46.031 --> 06:49.660
to finally punish them
will be a huge success?

06:49.743 --> 06:50.869
- Yay!
- Yay!

06:50.953 --> 06:52.871
Okay. Let's split up the work.

06:52.955 --> 06:54.873
And invade...

06:54.957 --> 06:56.125
- ...their rooms!
- ...their rooms!

06:58.252 --> 07:00.170
This is Panty's room?

07:00.254 --> 07:02.923
She's like a total trash hoarder.

07:03.924 --> 07:04.925
Click?

07:07.928 --> 07:09.179
What?

07:11.140 --> 07:12.933
My clothes!

07:20.691 --> 07:24.820
This... This feels dangerously unhinged.

07:24.903 --> 07:26.113
Nooo!

07:26.196 --> 07:27.990
Panty, I'm coming in.

07:28.073 --> 07:30.409
Wait! I didn't know the sisters
live with other people!

07:30.492 --> 07:33.787
And like, I'm gonna get totally destroyed
by this contraption!

07:33.871 --> 07:35.539
Stop, stop, wait, stop, stop, stop, stop!

07:42.838 --> 07:47.509
P-Panty! You're using the fully automatic
sex machine again?!

07:48.135 --> 07:52.431
<i>Wait. Has he not noticed,
or like, does he really think I'm Panty?</i>

07:52.514 --> 07:56.476
<i>Does she always use this creepy device?
She's supposed to be an angel.</i>

07:56.560 --> 07:59.479
S-So Panty, your back zipper...

07:59.563 --> 08:00.564
You're right.

08:00.647 --> 08:03.233
If-- if it's okay, I can do it!

08:03.317 --> 08:05.402
But not because I wanna or anything weird!
I mean--I mean, I just wanna help!

08:05.485 --> 08:08.238
Thanks. You're Brief, right?
Can you get it then?

08:08.322 --> 08:10.616
<i>Serious!? She's letting me!?</i>

08:10.699 --> 08:13.702
Wait? Brief?

08:13.785 --> 08:17.080
Wait, did Panty just call me Brief
instead of Geek Boy?

08:17.164 --> 08:20.209
The Panty I know? Called me by my name?
This is way too suspicious!

08:20.292 --> 08:22.127
Is this the real Panty standing
in front of me?

08:22.211 --> 08:23.503
Are you out of your mind, Brief?

08:23.587 --> 08:26.423
Stop yapping!
Behold the glory before your eyes!

08:26.506 --> 08:29.843
This is... the ultimate lovey-dovey
couple scenario I've dreamed of!

08:29.927 --> 08:32.429
The girl goes, "Oh, no.
My hand won't reach. Zip me up?"

08:32.512 --> 08:34.765
Don't worry if it's the real Panty.

08:34.848 --> 08:38.227
Focus on zipping the dress
in front of you!

08:38.310 --> 08:40.938
Focus!

08:41.021 --> 08:44.733
<i>He really thinks I'm Panty.</i>

08:44.816 --> 08:45.901
<i>I know!</i>

08:45.984 --> 08:47.945
Do you know what my weakness is?

08:48.028 --> 08:50.113
Fo... Fo...

08:50.197 --> 08:52.366
Focus.

08:57.788 --> 08:59.831
If I'm being

08:59.915 --> 09:00.958
for real...

09:03.627 --> 09:04.920
Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop.

09:05.003 --> 09:06.755
Miss Stocking, are you home?

09:06.838 --> 09:08.090
What?

09:08.173 --> 09:11.301
I didn't know the sisters lived
with anyone!

09:11.385 --> 09:14.972
I'm, like, definitely done for!

09:15.055 --> 09:18.141
I've made Hell's special
black mandrake tea.

09:18.225 --> 09:20.852
Oh, my. Miss Stocking.

09:20.936 --> 09:24.022
You've been binging on sweets again,
haven't you? Just look at that face!

09:24.106 --> 09:26.608
And what's with
the ridiculous contraption?

09:26.692 --> 09:28.193
Why are there demons?

09:28.443 --> 09:31.071
<i>Wait. Maybe they don't realize who I am.</i>

09:31.154 --> 09:34.992
Have you forgotten that we've been
living together for the past six months?

09:35.075 --> 09:38.537
Sister, expecting that level of memory
from an angel is rather optimistic.

09:38.620 --> 09:40.372
That's true.

09:40.455 --> 09:42.541
Get out of my face, annoying demons.

09:42.624 --> 09:45.377
<i>Oh wait... I can use them to get information</i>

09:45.460 --> 09:47.796
<i>about Stocking's weakness.</i>

09:47.879 --> 09:50.257
Excuse me? How rude.

09:50.340 --> 09:53.218
Demon, tell me my weakness.

09:53.302 --> 09:55.721
What? Your weakness? It's that--

09:55.804 --> 09:57.347
Do not speak, demon.

09:57.431 --> 09:59.683
No! Speak, demon!

10:01.476 --> 10:05.856
- The other day, your least favorite--
- No, shut it, demon! No, don't shut it!

10:05.939 --> 10:08.108
Hurry up and tell me!

10:11.278 --> 10:12.571
<i>It's time for dinner!</i>

10:14.156 --> 10:16.241
Man, I'm totally starving...

10:16.325 --> 10:18.035
What's for dinner tonight?

10:18.118 --> 10:21.288
It's Wednesday, so I'm guessing meat?

10:22.456 --> 10:25.000
- What's with your outfit?
- You too.

10:25.083 --> 10:27.377
Panty, Stocking. What are you doing?

10:27.461 --> 10:30.464
Today is Garter's special big black
frankfurter burgers!

10:30.547 --> 10:33.383
What's the matter? You're usually greedily
the first to devour them.

10:33.467 --> 10:35.010
Indeed. Just as Sister says.

10:36.345 --> 10:38.263
I think I might be hungry.

10:38.347 --> 10:41.683
But wait! I don't want to eat with demons!

10:44.603 --> 10:47.356
Hey! You damn angels! Dinner's
gettin' cold! Move your asses, now!

10:48.982 --> 10:50.275
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

10:50.359 --> 10:52.235
We're off angel duty!

10:52.319 --> 10:55.697
Wow, the big black frankfurter
burger looks delicious.

10:55.781 --> 10:58.241
Why did we come again?

10:58.325 --> 11:01.244
Like, who cares?

11:01.953 --> 11:02.996
You're right.

11:03.080 --> 11:05.123
- Thank you for the meal!
- Thank you for the meal!

11:05.624 --> 11:06.875
- <i>Over here!</i>
- <i>Over here!</i>

11:06.958 --> 11:09.961
Fuck! Which way is 'over here,' huh!?

11:10.045 --> 11:12.589
I know! "Over here" means that way!

11:12.672 --> 11:14.966
Okay, that way! Let's go, Stocking!

11:15.050 --> 11:16.051
Yeah!

11:20.555 --> 11:25.644
- <i>Six hundred Sixty Six Candles.</i>
- <i>Six hundred Sixty Six Candles.</i>

11:29.731 --> 11:31.441
It's ready.

11:32.609 --> 11:33.693
Open your eyes,

11:34.945 --> 11:36.279
Dearest Kneesocks.

11:37.364 --> 11:38.365
Wow.

11:39.074 --> 11:40.826
A big cake!

11:41.451 --> 11:43.036
Of course!

11:43.662 --> 11:46.081
It's your sixth birthday!

11:46.164 --> 11:48.625
Any demon knows, a birthday ending in six...

11:48.708 --> 11:51.670
demand most fabulous celebration.
It's simply the rule!

11:51.753 --> 11:54.005
Now hurry up.

11:55.424 --> 11:56.466
And one more thing.

11:56.550 --> 12:01.430
When you blow, make a wish,
and blow them out in one breath.

12:01.513 --> 12:04.599
That's the rule!

12:04.683 --> 12:05.892
Now, hurry, hurry!

12:10.480 --> 12:14.067
Happy birthday, Kneesocks!

12:15.652 --> 12:18.071
Wow! Thank you, Scanty!

12:20.907 --> 12:22.909
What beautiful glasses.

12:25.454 --> 12:28.874
- What do you think?
- Wow!

12:29.624 --> 12:32.961
I can see your beautiful face clearly!

12:33.044 --> 12:34.963
My my, Kneesocks.

12:36.631 --> 12:39.509
So what did you wish for?

12:40.093 --> 12:41.219
Um...

12:42.095 --> 12:44.473
I wished to spend all my birthdays

12:44.556 --> 12:47.642
with my beloved sister!

12:47.726 --> 12:49.019
Dear me.

12:49.102 --> 12:52.272
Then I shall grant your wish!

12:52.355 --> 12:54.774
- Really?
- Of course!

12:54.858 --> 12:57.235
Granting my cute little sister's wish!

12:57.319 --> 13:00.071
That is my responsibility
as your older sister!

13:00.155 --> 13:02.908
I swear to celebrate

13:02.991 --> 13:05.076
every birthday with you,

13:05.160 --> 13:06.745
no matter what.

13:09.831 --> 13:11.625
Listen, Kneesocks.

13:11.708 --> 13:14.878
Just between the two of us Demon sisters,

13:14.961 --> 13:16.963
this is our rule.

13:20.425 --> 13:23.178
<i>Dearest Sister... You liar.</i>

13:24.304 --> 13:25.722
<i>Currently, in this early morning,</i>

13:25.805 --> 13:30.685
<i>the ghost on Rodeo Street in western
Daten City escaped to the neighborhoods.</i>

13:30.769 --> 13:33.855
<i>Schools and residents in the
surrounding area should be on high alert.</i>

13:33.939 --> 13:36.691
<i>Angels who let the ghost escape are
questioned on their responsi--</i>

13:36.775 --> 13:37.984
Shut up!

13:41.029 --> 13:44.824
Had myself a breakfast fuck,
now I'm starving.

13:44.908 --> 13:46.535
Hey, Garter! Breakfast!

13:47.702 --> 13:49.704
Stocking! Chuck!

13:49.788 --> 13:51.122
Geek Boy!

13:51.206 --> 13:53.291
Fuck. Is no one here?

13:53.375 --> 13:55.752
- Hey, Scanty! Kneeso--
- Not here.

13:56.711 --> 13:59.673
Whoa! Say something if you're here!

13:59.756 --> 14:01.341
She's not here.

14:03.426 --> 14:05.262
I can't hear what you're saying.

14:05.345 --> 14:07.806
My sister isn't here!

14:08.682 --> 14:11.142
You scared me! Damn psycho demon!

14:11.226 --> 14:12.227
But...

14:12.310 --> 14:14.938
Maybe she's fighting ghosts
on her own or something.

14:15.564 --> 14:19.734
You two are always together anyways.
Why is today the exception?

14:19.818 --> 14:21.611
Today is my...

14:24.489 --> 14:27.409
What the-- You're actually crying?!

14:27.492 --> 14:30.078
- What's wrong?
- Chuck.

14:30.161 --> 14:33.623
- Okay, so it's your birthday.
- Mhm.

14:35.292 --> 14:39.170
Sister swore she would celebrate
my birthday with me

14:39.254 --> 14:42.924
every year since we were children.

14:43.675 --> 14:47.470
That was our rule as Demon sisters. But...

14:47.554 --> 14:50.515
What if Big sis Panty
celebrates with you instead?

14:50.599 --> 14:53.351
It's your fucking birthday! How's that?
You happy now?

14:53.435 --> 14:55.937
No. I absolutely refuse to be celebrated

14:56.021 --> 14:58.565
by a crude, dim-witted angel
such as yourself.

14:58.648 --> 15:01.109
- Contrarily, it's an insult.
- Fuck! What?

15:01.192 --> 15:03.486
Yikes, you're a total turn-off.

15:03.570 --> 15:05.488
Maybe that fabulous airhead demon

15:05.572 --> 15:08.617
ditched you cause you're
such an unlovable bitch.

15:08.700 --> 15:11.786
My Sister doesn't like me?

15:11.870 --> 15:12.871
Jeez, relax!

15:12.954 --> 15:14.623
What a pain in the ass.

15:14.706 --> 15:17.208
Who is it? Everyone's so annoying.

15:17.292 --> 15:18.585
Kinda busy right now!

15:18.668 --> 15:22.380
P-Panty! There's a prom party
at my high school tonight!

15:22.464 --> 15:23.590
Party?

15:23.673 --> 15:27.177
So, like, do you want to go with... I mean,
let's... If you would go with me...

15:27.260 --> 15:28.303
That's it!

15:28.386 --> 15:29.888
Let's go, Kneesocks.

15:30.555 --> 15:33.975
How long are you going to cry?
Get ready. We're heading out!

15:34.059 --> 15:36.144
Where exactly are you taking me?

15:36.227 --> 15:38.813
A party for a birthday! Duh!

15:38.897 --> 15:39.939
P-Party?!

15:40.023 --> 15:43.943
But what if my Sister returns
while I'm gone?

15:44.027 --> 15:46.237
You're still saying things like a loser?

15:46.321 --> 15:49.532
Whose birthday is it? It's yours, right?

15:49.616 --> 15:50.617
Yes.

15:50.700 --> 15:53.620
You're the birthday girl today! It's you!

15:53.703 --> 15:54.746
Me?

15:54.829 --> 15:56.748
Make your own decisions!

15:57.415 --> 15:59.167
So? What are you going to do?

15:59.250 --> 16:01.878
Are you going to sulk
by yourself all night?

16:02.379 --> 16:04.964
C'mon, let's go!

16:05.715 --> 16:10.345
But... I don't own anything appropriate
to wear to a place like that.

16:11.971 --> 16:14.140
Relax, wallflower.

16:14.224 --> 16:16.643
Leave everything to your sister Panty!

16:21.606 --> 16:22.941
Per-fect.

16:23.024 --> 16:25.985
- Let's go do finishing touches.
- What?

16:27.362 --> 16:29.030
What are you planning?

16:29.114 --> 16:31.241
Hey! Give her Brit's hairstyle.

16:31.324 --> 16:33.618
When she sang "Baby, One More Time."

16:34.744 --> 16:38.164
- Yeah!
- Daten City High School!

16:41.710 --> 16:43.378
We look on point.

16:44.129 --> 16:46.798
This attire makes me feel rather...
unsettled.

16:46.881 --> 16:49.008
You'll get used to it. Come on, let's go!

16:49.509 --> 16:51.261
Wait. What are you thinking?

16:51.344 --> 16:54.764
It's a party. We gotta dance.

16:54.848 --> 16:58.518
I don't know the rules of dancing--

16:58.601 --> 17:02.021
Rules this, rules that. You're so uptight.

17:02.105 --> 17:05.525
There's no rules to dancing.
You just let your body move to the song.

17:05.608 --> 17:09.487
Lose the glasses...
maybe you'll stop overthinking everything.

17:09.571 --> 17:13.241
Those are my special glasses my Sister--

17:27.672 --> 17:30.383
How is celebrating with your sister Panty?

17:31.468 --> 17:33.845
You're such a brat for an angel.

17:35.889 --> 17:37.265
What's going on?

17:37.348 --> 17:40.226
- Hi, Panty!
- And demon.

17:40.310 --> 17:42.020
The Poly Peeps are here!

17:42.103 --> 17:43.938
What are you scheming this time?

17:44.022 --> 17:47.776
Not scheming. We're off angel duty.

17:47.859 --> 17:50.612
So like, we're not thinking
about fighting at all.

17:50.695 --> 17:53.656
If anything, we're more
in the mood for a dance-off!

17:53.740 --> 17:56.993
You've got guts. Bring it!
Fucking plastics!

17:57.076 --> 17:58.912
A demon's hell fire dance!

17:58.995 --> 18:01.122
I'll let you see something nice
to take to your grave!

18:01.206 --> 18:02.332
Ready,

18:02.415 --> 18:03.583
fight!

18:04.209 --> 18:06.085
- Time out!
- What?

18:06.169 --> 18:08.630
Fuck! It's you again, Geek Boy?

18:08.713 --> 18:10.340
Don't interrupt me
in the middle of a dance off!

18:10.423 --> 18:13.218
Dance? You ignored my invitation!
With who?

18:13.301 --> 18:16.346
I can do whatever I want!
Don't get cocky, you fucking geek!

18:16.429 --> 18:18.223
Well, then be careful, Panty!

18:19.724 --> 18:22.560
<i>There's a ghost running around town
heading towards the high school.</i>

18:22.644 --> 18:26.314
- That one, okay.
- Where are the popular students?

18:26.397 --> 18:27.899
<i>It wants to eat you all--</i>

18:28.733 --> 18:33.321
What's that? It's a loser alumni that died
as an outcast who never got a single date!

18:33.404 --> 18:35.824
It's gotta be the Hierarchy Ghost born

18:35.907 --> 18:38.952
from the grudges of loser geeks.

18:40.745 --> 18:42.831
Who are you? You look cool.

18:42.914 --> 18:44.374
Actually, we're angels.

18:44.457 --> 18:48.378
But we're off angel duty. So we aren't
going to do anything to you.

18:49.170 --> 18:53.675
Come on! Off the clock or not, no one just
lets themselves get chomped like that!

18:53.758 --> 18:55.510
They're insane.

18:55.593 --> 18:58.388
I don't know if you're the grudges of
losers or whatever.

18:58.471 --> 19:00.932
But if you interrupt my dance, I, Panty,

19:01.015 --> 19:03.935
the party queen,

19:04.561 --> 19:06.312
will make you pay!

19:06.396 --> 19:08.356
Uh-oh. Fuck!

19:08.439 --> 19:10.149
My outfit was too good, I came commando!

19:10.233 --> 19:12.861
I'm at a loss for words, dumb miss angel.

19:13.695 --> 19:15.655
You vile spirit, daring to roam the Earth,

19:15.738 --> 19:19.576
I shall personally send you back to Hell.

19:22.954 --> 19:24.247
Prepare yourself!

19:31.045 --> 19:33.882
Could it be?!
By absorbing an angel into its body...

19:33.965 --> 19:37.093
it may have gained
the power to regenerate!

19:37.176 --> 19:38.678
What?

19:45.685 --> 19:46.895
Damn it.

19:50.231 --> 19:53.860
My precious glasses my Sister gave me...

19:53.943 --> 19:55.695
I will be sure to kill you...

19:55.778 --> 19:58.740
and banish you to Hell!

20:00.909 --> 20:03.036
Return to the darkness!

20:03.119 --> 20:05.997
Return! Return!

20:06.080 --> 20:08.958
It'll continue to regenerate as long
as the angels are inside.

20:09.042 --> 20:10.960
Kneesocks! Aim for his stomach!

20:11.044 --> 20:13.963
It's impossible! She lost her glasses so
her strikes aren't precise!

20:14.047 --> 20:15.798
Fuck! If only I had Backlace!

20:15.882 --> 20:19.135
- Panty! Use this panties!
- Geek Boy!

20:19.218 --> 20:22.096
It's the three trillion
Daten City dollar panty!

20:22.680 --> 20:24.057
Well done, Geek Boy!

20:24.140 --> 20:27.518
Your timing is orgasmic!

20:27.602 --> 20:29.312
Repent!

20:42.909 --> 20:44.494
Sister!

20:46.371 --> 20:48.539
Kneesocks, what happened?

20:48.623 --> 20:49.874
I could say the same!

20:49.958 --> 20:54.253
Fucking demon! I went through hell
because of you!

20:54.337 --> 20:56.631
You better buy me Voodoo Donuts later.

20:56.714 --> 20:57.882
Tell 'em, Stocking.

20:57.966 --> 21:01.344
I simply had no choice, now did I?

21:01.427 --> 21:04.681
Today just so happens to be
Kneesocks' 666th birthday, after all.

21:04.764 --> 21:08.101
Who knew I would run into a ghost on
the way back from buying a birthday gift?

21:08.184 --> 21:10.061
It's unbelievable.

21:10.144 --> 21:13.356
Kneesocks is 666 years old?

21:13.439 --> 21:14.440
She's an old hag.

21:14.524 --> 21:18.820
Being 666 in demon years is like being 16.

21:18.903 --> 21:21.864
That means we're the same age.
Happy birthday, Kneesocks!

21:21.948 --> 21:24.409
Just so you know, it's already morning.
Your birthday's technically over.

21:24.492 --> 21:25.827
Stocking...

21:25.910 --> 21:29.747
Sister, you remembered my birthday.

21:29.831 --> 21:31.040
Why of course!

21:31.124 --> 21:34.919
That's our rule as sisters!

21:35.003 --> 21:36.087
Oh, man.

21:36.170 --> 21:38.506
- I'm hungry.
- Me too!

21:38.589 --> 21:42.176
I'm a little bit late. But Kneesocks,

21:42.260 --> 21:44.470
happy birthday!

21:50.476 --> 21:52.353
Dearest Sister. It's...

21:52.437 --> 21:55.064
It was impossible finding the same pair.

21:55.148 --> 21:57.775
You've been wearing the same pair
since you were a child.

21:57.859 --> 21:59.736
They were so worn up.

22:01.362 --> 22:02.697
How are they?

22:03.823 --> 22:06.034
They're... Oh, so wonderful.

22:06.117 --> 22:07.410
So I don't know why

22:08.161 --> 22:11.873
your beautiful face looks blurry.

22:12.582 --> 22:15.084
Oh, my, Kneesocks. What's this?

22:15.752 --> 22:18.880
That fabulous dress!

22:18.963 --> 22:20.798
Your makeup is gorgeous too!

22:20.882 --> 22:22.508
Well... so...

22:22.592 --> 22:25.803
Garter, buy me dessert too.

22:28.556 --> 22:30.016
Kneesocks?

22:30.099 --> 22:32.935
It's a secret, even from you.

22:34.395 --> 22:36.773
You're keeping a secret from me?

22:36.856 --> 22:40.651
When did you become such a
rebellious little sister, Kneesocks?

22:40.735 --> 22:44.572
It must be bad influence
from those idiot angels!

24:22.920 --> 24:24.922
Subtitle: Emily Walton & Rychelle Brittain
